---
title: "kioskScreenTransition - Kiosk State Machine (AttendanceZen: Blueprint)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_standby: display clock + announcements + "touch card" prompt
    q_standby --> q_input: card input detected (HID keyboard)
    q_input --> q_processing: cardId received (Enter or 0.5s timeout)
    q_processing --> q_result_success: recordAttendance returns success
    q_processing --> q_result_error: recordAttendance returns error or card unregistered
    q_result_success --> q_standby: 5-second auto-return
    q_result_error --> q_standby: 5-second auto-return
    q_standby --> q_register_mode: "/" key pressed
    q_register_mode --> q_card_scan: waiting for card touch
    q_card_scan --> q_qr_display: createTempRegistration succeeds, QR code generated
    q_card_scan --> q_register_error: card already registered
    q_register_error --> q_standby: 5-second auto-return
    q_qr_display --> q_standby: QR code scanned (accessed_at updated) or Esc key
    q_register_mode --> q_standby: Esc key pressed (cancel)

    note right of q_standby
        INV-001: standby is the default and recovery state
        INV-002: result screens auto-return to standby after 5 seconds
        INV-003: QR display returns to standby on scan detection or Esc
        INV-004: Supabase Realtime updates announcements in standby
    end note
